sequenceDiagram
    participant M as MissionController
    participant N as NavigationMode
    participant X as NavigationModeExecutor
    participant P as PX4 VehicleStatus/API
    M->>M: trajectory endpoint / terminal witness
    M->>M: measured position + low speed + confirmation/dwell
    alt nonterminal STOP
    M-->>N: accepted waypoint / next PublishGoal
    else terminal STOP or safety RequestPositionControl
    M-->>N: Complete or RequestPositionControl
    N->>N: stationary setpoint path continues
    N->>X: request AUTO_LOITER
    X->>P: scheduleMode(Loiter)
    P-->>X: API callback result
    P-->>X: VehicleStatus AUTO_LOITER observation
    X->>X: confirmation latch and retry predicate
    end
    Note over M,P: API result, waypoint acceptance, mission completion and Hold confirmation are distinct.
